## Namespace policy
## `:` – unversioned base (kept for Protege compatibility; not used for entity definitions)
## `hm:` – versioned namespace used for all ontology entities
## All domain entities MUST use the hm: prefix.

@prefix : <https://w3id.org/mhm/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix xml: <http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix nli: <https://www.nli.org.il/en/authorities/> .
@prefix lrmoo: <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
@prefix cidoc-crm: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix hm: <https://w3id.org/mhm/ontology#> .
@prefix hmo: <https://w3id.org/mhm/ontology#> .
@base <https://w3id.org/mhm/> .

<https://w3id.org/mhm/ontology> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
    owl:versionIRI <https://w3id.org/mhm/ontology/1.8> ;
    owl:imports <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/1.0> ,
                 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.3> ;
    dcterms:title "Hebrew Manuscripts Ontology"@en ,
                  "אונטולוגיה לכתבי יד עבריים"@he ;
    dcterms:description """An ontology for describing Hebrew manuscripts metadata based on LRMoo and CIDOC-CRM, developed for the National Library of Israel Linked Open Data project.

VERSION 1.4 - 100% Expert Feedback Coverage
============================================

This version addresses all expert feedback from Prof. Moshe Lavi, Dr. Eliezer Baumgarten, and Prof. Gila Prebor on the Hebrew manuscript ontology.

NEW FEATURES:

1. DUAL PARADIGM SUPPORT (Resolves Gila's philosophical tension)
   - CatalogingView: Bibliographic-practical approach using LRM Work-Expression model
   - PhilologicalView: New philology approach treating each MS as unique cultural event
   - ParadigmBridge: Explicit bridging between Work and TextTradition concepts
   - Manuscripts can exist in both paradigms simultaneously
   - Suitable for both Wikidata integration and philological research

2. NESTED CODICOLOGICAL STRUCTURE (Addresses Eliezer's hierarchy concern)
   - has_sub_unit: Transitive property enabling recursive CU nesting
   - CodicologicalHierarchy: Manages complex manuscript compositions
   - CompositeCodicologicalUnit: Parent units containing sub-divisions
   - AtomicCodicologicalUnit: Leaf-level units
   - Supports MTM (Multiple Text Manuscripts), Sammelbands, complex anthologies

3. EPISTEMOLOGICAL FRAMEWORK (Addresses Moshe's fact vs interpretation concern)
   - EpistemologicalStatus: DirectObservation, ScholarlyInterpretation, ComputationalDerivation
   - EvidenceChain: Documents reasoning paths from raw data to conclusions
   - EvidenceStep hierarchy: DirectObservationStep, InterpretationStep, ComputationalStep
   - InterpretationMethod: Paleographic, Codicological, Linguistic, AI-based analysis
   - DataCategory: Distinguishes physical measurements, attributions, relationships

PREVIOUSLY IMPLEMENTED (v1.1-1.3):
- Certainty/confidence mechanisms with categorical and percentage values
- Variant and partial identification relationships
- Textual overlap properties for overlapping scribal units
- Multi-volume and anthology structures
- Scribal intervention documentation
- Lost manuscript handling
- Full granularity support (folio to character level)
- Canonical hierarchy references (Bible, Mishnah, Talmud, Mishneh Torah, Shulchan Aruch)
- Foreign unit marking for non-core manuscript components
- Text Tradition layer for philological transmission analysis

EXPERT FEEDBACK TEST CASES ADDRESSED:
- Vat 44: Multi-volume mechanism (MultiVolumeSet, is_volume_of)
- Huntington 115: Overlapping scribal hands (has_textual_overlap_with)
- Oppenheimer 128: Rigid hierarchy (nested CU with has_sub_unit)
- Parma 3122: Anthology structure (AnthologyStructure, AnthologyPosition)
- London Sifrei Toviah: Marginalia relationships (Marginalia, has_marginalia)
- Jerusalem 8210: Foreign units (UnitStatusType, is_foreign_addition)
- London 9599: Lost manuscripts (LostManuscript, is_copy_of_lost)

USAGE NOTES:
- For cataloging purposes: Use CatalogingView with Work-Expression-Manifestation
- For philological research: Use PhilologicalView with TextTradition-TransmissionWitness
- For complex manuscripts: Use CodicologicalHierarchy with nested has_sub_unit
- For all assertions: Attach EpistemologicalStatus to distinguish facts from interpretations
- For AI-derived data: Use ComputationalDerivation status with AIBasedAnalysis method

VERSION 1.5 - Administrative & Access Metadata (February 2026)
==============================================================

New classes: PhysicalHolding, DigitalAccess, UsageRestriction, RightsDetermination
New object properties: has_physical_holding, has_digital_access, has_usage_restriction, 
    has_rights_determination, has_related_material, held_at
New datatype properties: copyright_notice, related_material_note, acquisition_source,
    collection_name, restriction_type, restriction_url, rights_status, rights_basis,
    holding_institution, holding_sublibrary, holding_collection, holding_call_number,
    holding_availability, digital_access_url, digital_access_note, digital_access_type

These additions ensure complete coverage of all semantically meaningful MARC fields
from NLI records, including physical holdings (AVA), digital access (AVE), usage 
restrictions (939), rights determination (952), copyright (597), related materials 
(544), acquisition sources (541), and collection names (966).

VERSION 1.5.1 - Ontology Hygiene (February 2026)
==================================================

- Added named inverse hm:has_volume for hm:is_volume_of (replaces anonymous inverse in MultiVolumeSet restriction).
- Removed legacy hm:anthology_position datatype shortcut; canonical pattern: hm:has_anthology_position + hm:AnthologyPosition + hm:anthology_order.
- Added disjointness axioms: LostManuscript/AnthologyStructure, text-tradition classes, canonical reference subtypes.
- Documented Functional property semantics for is_volume_of.
- Clarified namespace policy (: vs hm: prefix).

VERSION 1.6 - Ontology Improvements (February 2026)
====================================================

- Documented anthology position: enhanced rdfs:comment on hm:has_anthology_position and hm:anthology_order.
- New inverse properties: hm:was_former_owner_of (inverse of hm:former_owner), hm:hosts_part (inverse of hm:is_part_of_host).
- Colophon: rdfs:comment clarifying that every Colophon must have at least one hm:colophon_text value.
- Disjointness: owl:AllDisjointClasses for E55_Type subclasses (ConditionType, VocalizationType, BindingType, etc.) and location classes (FolioLocation, LineLocation, WordLocation, CharacterLocation) already present.
- SHACL: minCount 1 for hm:external_identifier_nli (ManuscriptShape), hm:has_folio_range and hm:mentions_scribe (Warning), cidoc-crm:P4_has_time-span (Violation for production events).
- Breaking cleanup: removed legacy properties has_Script_Mode, external_wikidata_id, anthology_position, links_work_to_tradition, links_tradition_to_work; use canonical replacements only (see LEGACY_TO_CANONICAL_CHECKLIST.md).
- CIDOC-CRM: added E26_Physical_Feature class declaration (superclass of hm:Watermark).

VERSION 1.7 - Structural & Semantic Fixes (February 2026)
===========================================================

- R69_has_physical_form: domain changed from comma-intersection to owl:unionOf (F3_Manifestation OR F4_Manifestation_Singleton).
- Added lrmoo:R3i_realises as inverse of R3_is_realised_in; SHACL ExpressionShape and ExpressionWorkRule now use R3i_realises.
- hm:P44_has_condition: range narrowed from cidoc-crm:E55_Type to hm:ConditionType to match SHACL and usage.
- SHACL ProductionEventShape: replaced full IRIs with lrmoo: prefixed names (F32_Item_Production_Event, R27_materialized) so shape targets correct class.

VERSION 1.8 - Ontology Hygiene & SHACL (February 2026)
=========================================================

- Legacy aliases removed (breaking); canonical terms only.
- Removed redundant standalone owl:disjointWith for CatalogingView/PhilologicalView (kept AllDisjointClasses).
- Unified symmetric property syntax: rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty , owl:SymmetricProperty for parallels, has_textual_overlap_with, is_paradigm_compatible, adjacent_unit, competing_interpretation.
- Removed redundant rdfs:domain owl:Thing from 14 properties (has_certainty, attribution_source, attributed_by, has_location, external_identifier_nli, external_uri_nli, external_wikidata_uri, wikidata_id, certainty_percentage, certainty_note, has_epistemological_status, has_evidence_chain, data_category, is_factual).
- SHACL: added EvidenceChainShape, ParadigmBridgeShape, CompositeCodicologicalUnitShape, ManuscriptViewShape.

REASONING NOTES:
- This ontology is designed to be used with OWL-DL reasoners (e.g. Pellet, HermiT).
- Functional, Inverse, Transitive, and Asymmetric property characteristics are declared where appropriate.
- AllDisjointClasses and AllDifferent axioms enable reasoners to detect classification errors.
- For data validation beyond OWA entailment, use the companion SHACL shapes (shacl-shapes.ttl)."""@en ;
    dcterms:creator "Alexander Goldberg" ;
    dcterms:contributor "Prof. Gila Prebor" ,
                        "Prof. Moshe Lavi" ,
                        "Dr. Eliezer Baumgarten" ;
    dcterms:created "2025-12-06"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:modified "2026-02-06"^^xsd:date ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.9 - Query compatibility and LOD alignment with canonical + bridge properties; MARC-only external identifier policy retained; ontology hygiene fixes preserved from 1.8." .

#################################################################
#    Object Properties
#################################################################

### LRMoo Properties

lrmoo:R3_is_realised_in rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf lrmoo:R3i_realises ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F1_Work ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F2_Expression ;
    rdfs:label "is realised in"@en ,
               "ממומש ב"@he .

lrmoo:R3i_realises rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf lrmoo:R3_is_realised_in ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F2_Expression ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F1_Work ;
    rdfs:label "realises"@en ,
               "מממש"@he .

lrmoo:R4_embodies rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F2_Expression ;
    rdfs:label "embodies"@en ,
               "מגלם"@he .

lrmoo:R4i_is_embodied_in rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf lrmoo:R4_embodies ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F2_Expression ;
    rdfs:range [ a owl:Class ;
        owl:unionOf ( lrmoo:F3_Manifestation lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ) ] .

lrmoo:R5_has_component rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty , owl:TransitiveProperty ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf cidoc-crm:P46_is_composed_of ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range [ a owl:Class ;
        owl:unionOf ( lrmoo:F3_Manifestation lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ) ] ;
    rdfs:label "has component"@en ,
               "מורכב מ"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Links a composite manuscript to its components"@en .

lrmoo:R10_has_member rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf lrmoo:R10i_is_member_of ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F1_Work ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F1_Work ;
    rdfs:label "has member"@en ,
               "כולל חבר"@he .

lrmoo:R10i_is_member_of rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F1_Work ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F1_Work ;
    rdfs:label "is member of"@en .

lrmoo:R16_created rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf cidoc-crm:P94_has_created ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F27_Work_Creation ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F1_Work ;
    rdfs:label "created (Work Creation → Work)"@en .

lrmoo:R17_created rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf cidoc-crm:P94_has_created ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F2_Expression ;
    rdfs:label "created (Expression Creation → Expression)"@en .

lrmoo:R24_created rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf cidoc-crm:P94_has_created ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F30_Manifestation_Creation ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F3_Manifestation ;
    rdfs:label "created (Manifestation Creation → Manifestation)"@en .

lrmoo:R27_materialized rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf cidoc-crm:P94_has_created ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F32_Item_Production_Event ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:label "materialized (Item Production → Item)"@en .

lrmoo:R69_has_physical_form rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain [ a owl:Class ;
        owl:unionOf ( lrmoo:F3_Manifestation lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ) ] ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E55_Type ;
    rdfs:label "has physical form"@en ,
               "בעל צורה פיסית"@he .

lrmoo:R7_exemplifies rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf lrmoo:R7i_is_exemplified_by ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F3_Manifestation ;
    rdfs:label "exemplifies"@en ,
               "מגלם"@he .

lrmoo:R7i_is_exemplified_by rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:label "is exemplified by"@en ,
               "מגולם על ידי"@he .

### CIDOC-CRM Properties

cidoc-crm:P102_has_title rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E22_Human-Made_Object ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E35_Title ;
    rdfs:label "has title"@en ,
               "יש כותרת"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Associates a human-made object with its title"@en .

cidoc-crm:P129_is_about rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E73_Information_Object ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E1_CRM_Entity ;
    rdfs:label "is about"@en ,
               "עוסק ב"@he .

cidoc-crm:P138i_has_representation rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E73_Information_Object ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E36_Visual_Item ;
    rdfs:label "has representation"@en ,
               "יש ייצוג"@he .

cidoc-crm:P14_carried_out_by rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E7_Activity ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E39_Actor ;
    rdfs:label "carried out by"@en ,
               "בוצע על ידי"@he .

cidoc-crm:P16_used_specific_object rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E7_Activity ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E19_Physical_Object ;
    rdfs:label "used specific object"@en ,
               "השתמש בחפץ ספציפי"@he .

cidoc-crm:P16i_was_used_for rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf cidoc-crm:P16_used_specific_object ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E7_Activity ;
    rdfs:label "was used for"@en ,
               "שימש עבור"@he .

cidoc-crm:P1_is_identified_by rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E42_Identifier ;
    rdfs:label "is identified by"@en ,
               "מזוהה על ידי"@he .

cidoc-crm:P23_transferred_title_to rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf cidoc-crm:P24_transferred_title_from ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E8_Acquisition ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E39_Actor ;
    rdfs:label "transferred title to"@en ,
               "הועבר אל"@he .

cidoc-crm:P24_transferred_title_from rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E8_Acquisition ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E39_Actor ;
    rdfs:label "transferred title from"@en ,
               "הועבר מ"@he .

cidoc-crm:P28_custody_surrendered_by rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf cidoc-crm:P28i_custody_surrendered_in ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E10_Transfer_of_Custody ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E39_Actor ;
    rdfs:label "custody surrendered by"@en ,
               "מסר משמורת"@he .

cidoc-crm:P28i_custody_surrendered_in rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E39_Actor ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E10_Transfer_of_Custody ;
    rdfs:label "custody surrendered in"@en ,
               "מסר משמורת ב"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Transfer of custody in which the actor surrendered custody"@en .

cidoc-crm:P29_custody_received_by rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E10_Transfer_of_Custody ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E39_Actor ;
    rdfs:label "custody received by"@en ,
               "קיבל משמורת"@he .

cidoc-crm:P2_has_type rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E1_CRM_Entity ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E55_Type ;
    rdfs:label "has type"@en ,
               "מסוג"@he .

cidoc-crm:P46_is_composed_of rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E22_Human-Made_Object ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E22_Human-Made_Object ;
    rdfs:label "is composed of"@en ,
               "מורכב מ"@he .

cidoc-crm:P4_has_time-span rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E7_Activity ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E52_Time-Span ;
    rdfs:label "has time-span"@en ,
               "תקופת זמן"@he .

cidoc-crm:P70_documents rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:label "documents"@en ,
               "מתעד"@he .

cidoc-crm:P70i_is_documented_in rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf cidoc-crm:P70_documents ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F3_Manifestation ;
    rdfs:label "is documented in"@en ,
               "מתועד ב"@he .

cidoc-crm:P72_has_language rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F2_Expression ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E56_Language ;
    rdfs:label "has language"@en ,
               "כתוב בשפה"@he .

cidoc-crm:P74_has_current_or_former_residence rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E39_Actor ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E53_Place ;
    rdfs:label "has current or former residence"@en ,
               "ממוקם ב"@he .

cidoc-crm:P7_took_place_at rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E7_Activity ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E53_Place ;
    rdfs:label "took place at"@en ,
               "התרחש ב"@he .

cidoc-crm:P89_falls_within rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E53_Place ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E53_Place ;
    rdfs:label "falls within"@en ,
               "נופל בתוך"@he .

cidoc-crm:P94_has_created rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain cidoc-crm:E65_Creation ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E28_Conceptual_Object ;
    rdfs:label "has created"@en ,
               "יצר"@he .

cidoc-crm:E12_Production rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
    owl:onProperty cidoc-crm:P14_carried_out_by ;
    owl:someValuesFrom cidoc-crm:E21_Person ] .

### Hebrew Manuscripts Custom Object Properties

hm:P44_has_condition rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range hm:ConditionType ;
    rdfs:label "has condition"@en ,
               "מצב פיסי"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Physical condition of the manuscript"@en .

hm:has_script_mode rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range hm:ModeScriptType ;
    rdfs:label "has script mode"@en ,
               "סוג הכתב (מרובע, בינוני, רהוט)"@he .

hm:has_colophon rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf hm:is_colophon_of ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range hm:Colophon ;
    rdfs:label "has colophon"@en ,
               "יש קולופון"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Links a manuscript to its colophon(s)"@en .

hm:is_colophon_of rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf hm:has_colophon ;
    rdfs:domain hm:Colophon ;
    rdfs:range lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:label "is colophon of"@en ,
               "קולופון של"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Links a colophon to the manuscript it belongs to"@en .

hm:has_date_of_creation rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E52_Time-Span ;
    rdfs:label "has date of creation"@en ,
               "תאריך יצירה"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Links a manuscript to its creation date or time-span"@en .

hm:has_material rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E57_Material ;
    rdfs:label "has material"@en ,
               "חומר"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Links a manuscript to its writing support material (e.g. parchment, paper)"@en .

hm:has_script_type rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range hm:TypeScriptType ;
    rdfs:label "has script type"@en ,
               "סוג כתב"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Links a manuscript to its script type (e.g. Square, Semicursive, Cursive)"@en .

hm:mentions_date rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hm:Colophon ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E52_Time-Span ;
    rdfs:label "mentions date"@en ,
               "מזכיר תאריך"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Links a colophon to the date or time-span it mentions"@en .

hm:mentions_person rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E21_Person ;
    rdfs:label "mentions person"@en ,
               "שם אדם שמוזכר בכתב היד"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Links a manuscript to a person mentioned in it"@en .

hm:mentions_place rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hm:Colophon ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E53_Place ;
    rdfs:label "mentions place"@en ,
               "מזכיר מקום"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Links a colophon to the place it mentions"@en .

hm:mentions_scribe rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hm:Colophon ;
    rdfs:range cidoc-crm:E21_Person ;
    rdfs:label "mentions scribe"@en ,
               "סופר מוזכר"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Links a colophon to the scribe it mentions"@en .

### NEW Object Properties (Added in v1.1)

hm:has_binding rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf hm:is_binding_of ;
    rdfs:domain lrmoo:F4_Manifestation_Singleton ;
    rdfs:range hm:Binding ;
    rdfs:label "has binding"@en ,
               "כריכה"@he ;
    rdfs:comment "Links a manuscript to its binding description"@en .

hm:is_binding_of rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
